<title>UK: Second Brent date kept by equity holder - trade.</title>
<headline>Second Brent date kept by equity holder - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The second Brent cargo nominated August 13-15 loading dates on Tuesday was kept by equity holder Total, traders said.</p>
<p>Another 13-15 loader was kept early from the chains and sold at August Brent +2 cents.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 5387</p>
</text>
